Stationeers IDE
===============

An unofficial, fan-made tool. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by or
supported by RocketWerkz. Stationeers is a game by RocketWerkz, who own its
name.

The project's own code is licensed under MIT or Apache-2.0, at your option
(LICENSE-MIT, LICENSE-APACHE).

Not covered by that license
---------------------------
These come from Stationeers and are (c) RocketWerkz. They are included to help
players write scripts for the game, and will be removed on request:

- assets/game-art/      device icons extracted from the game
- data/game/            device, logic type, constant and instruction data
                        exported from the game, including the instruction
                        descriptions from its English text
- tools/extract/tests/fixtures/
                        small samples of the same exported data

The same holds for copies of them in builds of the IDE (the web app and the
release zips).

Requests (including removal requests from RocketWerkz): open an issue at
https://github.com/stationeers-ide/stationeers-ide.github.io/issues
